<title>FRANCE: French 1998 budget to be put before cabinet Sep 24.</title>
<headline>French 1998 budget to be put before cabinet Sep 24.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The French 1998 Finance Act will be presented to the cabinet on September 24, Finance Minister Dominique Strauss-Kahn said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The presentation to the cabinet is the first step in the budget approval process.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +331 4221 5452</p>
</text>
